---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Horizon Forbidden West — PS5 Buying Guide"
  description="Horizon Forbidden West buying guide: Complete Edition vs standard, DLC, and where to buy the digital PS5 version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Horizon Forbidden West — PS5 Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation 5 · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Horizon Forbidden West</strong> is Guerrilla's open-world sequel following
      Aloy across a lush, machine-filled post-apocalyptic America. It's one of the
      best-looking games on PS5.
    </p>

    <h2>Standard vs Complete Edition</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the main game only</li>
      <li><strong>Complete Edition</strong> — bundles the <em>Burning Shores</em> story DLC; usually the better value if you want the whole story</li>
      <li><strong>Digital vs physical</strong> — digital installs instantly and often goes cheaper on key stores</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      PSN digital codes for Forbidden West on Green Man Gaming routinely undercut the
      PlayStation Store, especially for the Complete Edition. If you only want the base
      game and plan to skip the DLC, watch for standalone key-store cuts.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=horizon+forbidden+west+ps5"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Horizon+Forbidden+West+PS5"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
